[17.687, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m The backlog already answers the design questions: plan on PR, apply on\r\n"]
[18.587, "o", "  merge, and never auto-apply a plan that contains destroys — a delete\r\n"]
[19.387, "o", "  stops the job and waits for a human. Weakest blast radius first.\r\n"]
[21.187, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m  ── plus tard dans la session : tester la porte pour vrai ──\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.787, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.337, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m PR #2 is open: it deletes the throwaway TXT record created by PR #1.\r\n"]
[24.237, "o", "  The plan comment flags it loudly:\r\n"]
[25.237, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;174m⛔ Plan contains 1 destroy — the apply workflow will refuse this\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.737, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;174m   cloudflare_dns_record.cicd_test_txt\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.337, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.887, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mMerge PR #2 — the apply run must FAIL at the destroy gate.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.787, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.987, "o", "\r\n"]
[32.537, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── iac-auto-deploy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
